no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.moderation..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.user..',\ because\ Moderation\ reaches\ users\ via\ Auth\ RPC\ (C)\ or\ event\ (E),\ not\ direct\ User/UserMapper.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=85651ef4-a586-4c66-a3f4-e0fecdb48092
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.submission..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.queue.service..',\ because\ Submission\ depends\ on\ queue\ ports\ only.\ QueueService\ is\ internal;\ JudgeQueue\ port\ is\ the\ public\ surface.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=7c71e790-1f82-45d1-a541-e4c35b3f2106
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.admin..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['com.ulticode.modules.contest.mapper..',\ 'com.ulticode.modules.contest.service..'],\ because\ Admin\ reads\ Contest\ via\ Q/E\ (RPC/outbox)\ or\ the\ new\ Phase\ 3\ owner\ port\ (com.ulticode.modules.contest.port..),\ not\ direct\ Mapper/Service.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY\ for\ the\ frozen\ baseline\ and\ burn-down\ list.=db176a3c-cf13-4017-a225-73c8bab408a0
no\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.submission..'\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.ulticode.modules.queue.outbox..',\ because\ Submission\ depends\ on\ queue\ ports\ only.\ Reaching\ queue.outbox\ (JudgeOutboxRecord/Mapper,\ dispatcher,\ reaper)\ is\ internal\ to\ the\ queue\ module.\ See\ ADR-MIG-ARCH-BOUNDARY.=b95f3187-eda7-4702-9eed-fa3f85e355de
